   dynamic of a plant-parasite model is analyzed. It is assumed that the
   plant-Trichoderma spp. relationship is mutualistic, the Trichoderma
   spp.-parasite relationship is that of predator-prey, and the parasite is
   specialist. Conditions for pest eradication and for species coexistence
