   Mata-Torres, Gerardo; Andrade-Cetto, Adolfo; Espinoza-Hernandez, Fernanda, Univ Nacl Autonoma Mexico, Fac Ciencias, Dept Biol Celular, Lab Etnofarmacol, Mexico City, DF, Mexico.},
